  "title": {
    "nl": "uur · kleur · mens",
    "zh": "钟点、颜色、人的单复数",
    "en": "Time, colours, singular and plural"
  },
  "nn_lessons": ["NN02", "NN03", "NN04"],
  "reading": "NN19",
  "sounds": [
    {
      "grapheme": "uur · half",
      "note_zh": "钟点：整点说“… uur”：Het is drie uur（三点）。半点要特别注意：half vier 是“三点半”（离四点还差半小时），不是四点半！kwart over twee 是两点一刻。half 的 a 短，l 要读出来。",
      "note_en": "Time: 'half vier' is 3:30 (half to four), not 4:30. 'kwart over twee' is 2:15.",
      "word_ids": ["w_uur", "w_half", "w_kwart", "w_hoe_laat"]
    },
    {
      "grapheme": "kleur",
      "note_zh": "颜色：rood、geel、blauw 前面学过。groen 的 oe 读“乌”；zwart 的 zw 连在一起读；wit 的 i 短；oranje 的 nj 像“尼亚”快速连读；paars 的 aa 长。",
      "note_en": "Colours: groen (oe = 'oo'), zwart (zw together), wit (short i), oranje (nj as in Spanish ñ), paars (long aa).",
      "word_ids": ["w_kleur", "w_groen", "w_zwart", "w_wit", "w_oranje", "w_paars", "w_rood", "w_geel", "w_blauw"]
    },
    {
      "grapheme": "-en",
      "note_zh": "人和身体：复数大多加 -en，拼写跟着发音变：短元音后面的辅音要双写（man → mannen），长元音在开音节里只写一个字母（been → benen），s 常变 z（neus → neuzen）。kind 的复数特别：kinderen。",
      "note_en": "Plurals mostly add -en: man → mannen (short vowel, double consonant), been → benen (long vowel, one letter), kind → kinderen.",
      "word_ids": ["w_mens", "w_kind", "w_hand", "w_been", "w_hoofd"]
    }
  ],
